title: Antikythera mathematics

# Three research notebooks (the bronze antikythera mechanism, the
# JPL DE441 ephemerides instrument, and the doom-spectral lattice)
# flanked by their PyPI packages (antikythera-spectral,
# ephemerides-spectral) and the underlying research code. Older
# planning / instructions docs come last.
#
# IMPORTANT: This is an explicit-nav file, which means
# awesome-pages treats the list as a whitelist -- any sibling .md
# or subdirectory NOT listed here is silently excluded from the
# RTD sidebar (it remains indexed by site search). When you add a
# new notebook or subfolder under docs/antikythera-maths/,
# remember to add it here too or it will appear to "vanish" from
# the published nav.

nav:
  - antikythera_spectral_research_notebook.md
  - ephemerides_spectral_research_notebook.md
  - doom_spectral_research_notebook.md
  - antikythera-spectral
  - ephemerides-spectral
  - research
  - figures
  - results
  - scripts
  # Planning + agent-handoff docs at the bottom; useful for project
  # archaeology but not high-priority reading.
  - ANTIKYTHERA_SPECTRAL_INSTRUCTIONS.md
  - ANTIKYTHERA_SPECTRAL_PYPI_PLAN_v0.1.0.md
  - ANTIKYTHERA_SPECTRAL_BUILD_PROMPT.md
  - ANTIKYTHERA_PHASE_OP_PREFLIGHT.md
  - SESSION_HANDOFF.md
